      "caption": "Explore the SPL atlas\u2019s original T1/T2 MRI and twelve left/right labels for the hippocampus, amygdala, fornix, mammillary body, parahippocampal gyrus and mammillothalamic tract. The default surfaces follow every exposed categorical voxel face, retaining small components. Separately selectable original publisher surfaces can differ substantially, especially at the fornices. This single-subject research atlas supplies source anatomy context; it does not supply separate CA fields or subiculum, patient registration, diagnostic validation or complete reporting anatomy.",
